  Onboarded: "已接入",
  "Parameters refreshed": "参数已刷新",
  "Full-range USDC/USDT liquidity accepted in the Stable spoke at up to 78% LTV.":
    "全区间 USDC/USDT 流动性可在 Stable 分支中以最高 78% LTV 接受。",
  "Stable spoke launch": "Stable 分支上线",
  "De-peg drill": "脱锚演练",
  "Risk council": "风险委员会",
  "Fee-split": "手续费分成",
  "ETH/USDC 0.30% is the deepest Uniswap v3 pool by volume and functions as the benchmark pair for ETH price discovery. The Bluechip spoke accepts these LP positions as borrow collateral, which means this market sits at the intersection of deep trading liquidity, a stable quote asset, and a higher-risk volatile leg. The combination gives borrowers meaningful capacity while still keeping the underwriting rules conservative enough to absorb ETH drawdowns.":
    "ETH/USDC 0.30% 是按成交量计 Uniswap v3 中最深的池，充当 ETH 价格发现的基准交易对。Bluechip 分支接受这些 LP 头寸作为借款抵押品，这意味着该市场处于深度交易流动性、稳定计价资产与高风险波动腿的交汇点。这一组合在为借款人提供可观额度的同时，仍保持承保规则足够稳健，以吸收 ETH 的回撤。",
  "Uni v3 Bluechip added as collateral source.": "已将 Uni v3 Bluechip 添加为抵押品来源。",
  "Risk council bumped the ceiling from 65% to 70%.": "风险委员会将上限从 65% 提升至 70%。",
  "Switched from 60m to 30m TWAP.": "已从 60m TWAP 切换为 30m TWAP。",
  "30d realized σ ≈ 58% annualized — the single biggest contributor to impermanent loss.":
    "30d 已实现 σ ≈ 58% 年化 — 无常损失的单一最大贡献因素。",
  "$4.1M of 2% depth across all tiers — ample for liquidations.": "各费率层合计 2% 深度达 $4.1M — 足以应对清算。",
  "30-minute TWAP can lag during sharp moves; mitigated by kink in the risk curve.":
    "30 分钟 TWAP 在剧烈波动时可能滞后；已通过风险曲线的拐点予以缓释。",
  "Uniswap v3 core + NonFungiblePositionManager, both heavily audited and live for 4 years.":
    "Uniswap v3 core + NonFungiblePositionManager，两者均经过深度审计并已上线 4 年。",
  "Rolling 90d IL averages 23bps per week for the 0.30% tier.": "滚动 90d 无常损失在 0.30% 费率层平均为每周 23bps。",
  "WBTC/WETH is the dominant on-chain BTC↔ETH trading pair and one of the most familiar blue-chip routes in DeFi. The Bluechip spoke allows it as collateral with a conservative 67% LTV because bridged-BTC custody risk, even when well managed, still deserves a tighter margin than native ETH pairs. That keeps borrowing power useful without treating wrapped BTC like a pure base-asset market.":
    "WBTC/WETH 是链上主导的 BTC↔ETH 交易对，也是 DeFi 中最为人熟知的蓝筹路线之一。Bluechip 分支以稳健的 67% LTV 接受它作为抵押品，因为桥接 BTC 的托管风险即使管理良好，仍应比原生 ETH 交易对留出更紧的保证金。这既保持了借款能力的实用性，又不把封装 BTC 当作纯基础资产市场对待。",
  "WBTC/WETH added to the Bluechip spoke.": "已将 WBTC/WETH 添加至 Bluechip 分支。",
  "Added Chainlink feed alongside the TWAP for resilience.": "已在 TWAP 之外新增 Chainlink 喂价以增强韧性。",
  "30d realized σ ≈ 48% annualized.": "30d 已实现 σ ≈ 48% 年化。",
  "WBTC depends on BitGo custody — reviewed monthly by the risk council.":
    "WBTC 依赖 BitGo 托管 — 由风险委员会每月审查。",
  "Chainlink feed + 30m TWAP with deviation guardrails.": "Chainlink 喂价 + 30m TWAP，并配有偏差防护。",
  "$2.6M of 2% depth.": "2% 深度达 $2.6M。",
  "BTC/ETH is highly correlated — IL is usually <15bps/week.": "BTC/ETH 高度相关 — 无常损失通常 <15bps/周。",
  "WETH/DAI is a standard Uniswap v2 ETH/stable pair and a straightforward LP structure for collateral evaluation. The Uniswap v2 spoke admits it under conservative parameters because the pair still carries ETH volatility, while the stable quote side keeps the market easy to reason about.":
    "WETH/DAI 是标准的 Uniswap v2 ETH/稳定币交易对，也是一种便于抵押品评估的直观 LP 结构。Uniswap v2 分支在稳健参数下接受它，因为该交易对仍带有 ETH 波动性，而稳定计价一侧则使市场易于分析。",
  "Added to the Uniswap v2 LPs.": "已添加至 Uniswap v2 LP。",
  "Quarterly risk review — no changes to LTV.": "季度风险审查 — LTV 无变更。",
  "USDC and USDT both trade at parity and the pool is overwhelmingly used for order-routing, stability-seeking flow, and tight-spread execution. The Stable spoke admits it with a high LTV because peg-risk is shared, depth is enormous, and the pool behaves more like cash infrastructure than a typical volatile LP. That makes it a natural fit for users who want borrowing power while keeping the underlying collateral profile simple to reason about.":
    "USDC 与 USDT 均按平价交易，该池绝大多数用于订单路由、寻求稳定的资金流动与紧价差执行。Stable 分支以高 LTV 接受它，因为脱锚风险由双方共担、深度巨大，且该池的表现更像现金基础设施而非典型的波动型 LP。这使它非常适合希望获得借款能力、同时保持底层抵押品状况便于分析的用户。",
  "USDC/USDT included from day 1.": "USDC/USDT 自第 1 天起纳入。",
  "Circuit-breaker simulated during USDC March 2023 re-run — no forced liquidations.":
    "在重演 2023 年 3 月 USDC 事件期间模拟了熔断机制 — 未发生强制清算。",
  "Guardrails pause new borrows if the Chainlink feed deviates >50bps for 5m.":
    "若 Chainlink 喂价偏差 >50bps 持续 5m，防护机制将暂停新增借款。",
  "Circle + Tether attestations ingested weekly.": "每周摄入 Circle + Tether 的证明。",
  "$18M of 2% depth.": "2% 深度达 $18M。",
  "Uniswap v3 + LP NFT only.": "仅 Uniswap v3 + LP NFT。",
  "Correlated assets → IL near zero in normal conditions.": "相关资产 → 正常情况下无常损失接近于零。",
  "ETH/USDC on Uniswap v3 is deep and battle-tested but exposes LPs to ETH volatility. Risk is dominated by impermanent loss and, to a lesser degree, oracle latency during fast moves.":
    "Uniswap v3 上的 ETH/USDC 深度充足且久经考验，但会使 LP 暴露于 ETH 波动性。风险主要由无常损失主导，其次是快速波动期间的预言机延迟。",
  "WBTC carries BitGo custody risk on top of BTC volatility. The pair's depth is comfortable and the dual-oracle setup mitigates single-feed failure modes.":
    "WBTC 在 BTC 波动性之上还带有 BitGo 托管风险。该交易对深度充裕，双预言机设置可缓释单一喂价失效模式。",
  "Peg-to-peg correlation keeps impermanent loss negligible. The only tail scenarios involve a USDC or USDT de-peg; both are paused automatically by our oracle deviation guard.":
    "锚定对锚定的相关性使无常损失可忽略不计。唯一的尾部情形涉及 USDC 或 USDT 脱锚；两者都会被我们的预言机偏差防护自动暂停。",
  "Quarterly risk review touches every active pool.": "季度风险审查覆盖每一个活跃池。",
  "90% of swap fees flow to suppliers, 10% to the protocol treasury.": "90% 的兑换手续费流向供应方，10% 流向协议金库。",
