  "Collateral factor": "抵押系数",
  "Available liquidity": "可用流动性",
  "Spread / slippage": "价差 / 滑点",
  "Max leverage": "最大杠杆",
  "Liquidation threshold": "清算阈值",
  "Pair volatility": "交易对波动率",
  "Source dex": "来源 dex",
  Spoke: "分支",
  "Supply APY range": "供应 APY 区间",
  "Guardrails pause new borrows on >50bps deviation for 5m.": "若偏差 >50bps 持续 5m，防护机制将暂停新增借款。",
  "Attestations / reserve reports monitored weekly.": "每周监控证明 / 储备报告。",
  "Only canonical bridges accepted.": "仅接受规范桥。",
  "Standard ERC-20 implementations only.": "仅限标准 ERC-20 实现。",
  "30d σ relative to the category's target band.": "相对于该类别目标区间的 30d σ。",
  "Chainlink feed + deviation guard.": "Chainlink 喂价 + 偏差防护。",
  "Depth across routing venues.": "跨路由场所的深度。",
  "Token contract + wrapper if applicable.": "代币合约 + 封装器（如适用）。",
  "Available liquidity vs. utilization; high utilization can delay withdrawals.":
    "可用流动性对比利用率；高利用率可能延迟提取。",
  "Supply vault + oracle dependencies, reviewed by the risk council.": "供应金库 + 预言机依赖，由风险委员会审查。",
  "The reserve factor accrues a protocol safety buffer from borrower interest.":
    "储备系数从借款人利息中累积协议安全缓冲。",
  "Higher leverage magnifies both upside and liquidation speed.": "更高杠杆会同时放大收益与清算速度。",
  "Borrow cost moves with utilization and market stress.": "借款成本随利用率与市场压力变动。",
  "The collateral leg sets how much buffer remains before liquidations.": "抵押品腿决定清算前还剩多少缓冲。",
  "Available capital limits how much of the market can be opened at once.": "可用资金限制了一次能开启多少市场额度。",
  "Execution quality matters more as position size increases.": "随着头寸规模增大，执行质量愈发重要。",
  "Realized 30d σ relative to the spoke's target band.": "相对于分支目标区间的已实现 30d σ。",
  "Depth at ±2% is above the spoke's liquidation threshold.": "±2% 处的深度高于分支的清算阈值。",
  "Primary oracle + deviation guard monitored by the risk council.": "主预言机 + 偏差防护，由风险委员会监控。",
  "Source dex + LP wrapper audits reviewed quarterly.": "来源 dex + LP 封装器审计，每季度审查。",
  "Rolling 90d weekly impermanent loss for this tier.": "该费率层滚动 90d 每周无常损失。",
  "What is the reserve factor?": "什么是储备系数？",
  "How does max APY work here?": "这里的最高 APY 如何计算？",
  "Why is leverage capped?": "为什么杠杆有上限？",
  "How do liquidity providers earn?": "流动性提供者如何赚取收益？",
  "What is impermanent loss?": "什么是无常损失？",
  "What happens if the price moves outside the active range?": "如果价格移动到活跃区间之外会怎样？",
  "What should I watch before adding liquidity?": "添加流动性前我应关注什么？",
  "The reserve factor is the share of borrower interest the protocol retains as a safety buffer rather than passing to suppliers. Lower-risk markets use a smaller reserve factor.":
    "储备系数是协议从借款人利息中保留作为安全缓冲、而非转付给供应方的部分。风险较低的市场使用较小的储备系数。",
  "Max APY reflects the combination of collateral carry and borrow cost at the current leverage ceiling. It is the ceiling shown in the table, not a fixed return.":
    "最高 APY 反映了当前杠杆上限下抵押品套息与借款成本的组合。它是表格中显示的上限，而非固定回报。",
  "The cap keeps liquidation risk within the available liquidity and collateral threshold for the pair. Higher leverage increases both capital efficiency and unwind speed.":
    "该上限使清算风险保持在该交易对的可用流动性与抵押品阈值之内。更高杠杆会同时提升资本效率与平仓速度。",
  "LPs earn a share of the swap fees generated by the pool. The higher the trading activity, the more fee flow the position can capture, though returns still depend on market movement and range usage.":
    "LP 赚取池所产生兑换手续费的一部分。交易活动越活跃，头寸能捕获的手续费流越多，但回报仍取决于市场走势与区间使用情况。",
  "Impermanent loss is the gap between holding the two tokens outright and providing them in a pool while the price moves. It is usually smaller in calmer pairs and larger when one side moves sharply.":
    "无常损失是指直接持有两种代币，与在价格变动期间将它们投入池中提供流动性之间的差距。它在较平稳的交易对中通常较小，而在某一方剧烈波动时较大。",
  "In concentrated-liquidity pools, the position can stop earning fees until price comes back into range. That tradeoff is the main reason tighter ranges can earn more, but also require more active management.":
    "在集中流动性池中，头寸可能停止赚取手续费，直到价格回到区间内。这一取舍是更窄区间能赚取更多、但也需要更主动管理的主要原因。",
  "Check the fee tier, current depth, volatility, and how often the pool rebalances around the current price. Rapid price moves can increase divergence risk and reduce the time a narrow range stays active.":
    "查看费率层、当前深度、波动率，以及池围绕当前价格的再平衡频率。快速的价格波动会增加背离风险，并缩短窄区间保持活跃的时间。",
  "Rewards APY": "奖励 APY",
  "Reserve Factor": "储备系数",
  Interest: "利息",
  "Market listed": "市场已上架",
  "Risk limits refreshed": "风险限额已刷新",
  "Updated leverage and availability parameters.": "已更新杠杆与可用性参数。",
  Cashflow: "现金流",
  Engagement: "参与度",
